3. GC10-DET dataset (original authors)
------------------------------------------------------------------

The model in this repository was trained on GC10-DET, a public steel surface
defect dataset.

  Dataset          : GC10-DET (NEU surface defect database derivative,
                     GC10-DET release)
  Referenced from  : https://huggingface.co/datasets/dronefreak/GC10-DET
  Retrieved by     : scripts/download_gc10.py

This repository does NOT redistribute the dataset. The `data/` directory is
excluded via .gitignore, and no images or labels from GC10-DET are committed
to this repository. Only a download script and a YAML template are provided.

All rights in the dataset remain with its original authors. If you use the
dataset, cite the original publication and comply with its terms. The class
names, split sizes, and label statistics reported in docs/EVAL.md and
docs/DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md are descriptive measurements of that dataset, not a
redistribution of it.

